    "recovery.present.errNoShard": "No shard is stored on this device under that code. Custody keeps no list to search — if the code is wrong or this is not your device, the member-present path cannot start. Two sponsor shards cannot stand in for yours: use the sponsor-only path instead, with its 7-day window.",
